		{"id":"39fbe072c0756d96","type":"text","text":"# Katsuki Toshio\n\nTeam leader, Tama Forest Science Garden, Forestry and Forestry Products Research Institute . Specialist in dendrology, plant taxonomy, and forest ecology. Born in Fukuoka Prefecture in 1967. Earned a master’s degree in agriculture from the University of Tokyo; went on to earn his doctorate in agriculture. Author of _Ikimono no deai zukan: Nihon no sakura_ (Illustrated Reference Book of Nature: Japan’s Sakura), _Sakura_(Sakura), and _Sakura no kagaku_ (The Science of Sakura).","x":1711,"y":1080,"width":287,"height":344},
